<title>PORTUGAL: Expectations for Portugal trade favourable - INE.</title>
<headline>Expectations for Portugal trade favourable - INE.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Expectations for sales and job creation in the retail and wholesale trade sector in Portugal are positive and the second quarter was more favourable than a year earlier, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>&quot;For the next quarter, expectations for sales and job creation are more optimistic,&quot; INE said in a monthly report for July, based on a survey of business people.</p>
<p>&quot;In both sub-sectors (wholesale and retail trade), the opinions of business people about turnover were more favourable than a year ago,&quot; it added.</p>
</text>
